# # /basetwin/
#
# Permanent identifiers for BaseTwin, an open-source (Apache-2.0) digital twin
# core built on NGSI-LD.
#
# https://w3id.org/basetwin/context/v1.jsonld redirects to the JSON-LD context,
#   version 1 (append-only: terms are only added within v1)
# https://w3id.org/basetwin/ns redirects to the vocabulary page of the bt:
#   terms (namespace https://w3id.org/basetwin/ns#)
# Anything else redirects to the public landing page
#   https://ngdovan.github.io/basetwin-context/
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Nguyen Do Van
# GitHub username: ngdovan

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^context/v1(\.jsonld)?$ https://ngdovan.github.io/basetwin-context/context/v1.jsonld [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^ns/?$ https://ngdovan.github.io/basetwin-context/ns/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://ngdovan.github.io/basetwin-context/ [R=302,L]
